# 43. CORE RULES

```text
RULE 01
All Recruitable Races have equal base RNG probability.

RULE 02
Race probability does not determine combat power.

RULE 03
Every Race must have its own strengths.

RULE 04
Every Race must have identifiable weaknesses.

RULE 05
Race influences Base Stats.

RULE 06
Race influences Skill Affinity.

RULE 07
Race influences Bloodline Pool.

RULE 08
Race influences Family Pool.

RULE 09
Race can influence Hidden Potential.

RULE 10
Race can influence World Exploration Events.

RULE 11
Race can influence Emotional Resonance.

RULE 12
Race does not determine Personality completely.

RULE 13
Character AI remains responsible for behavior.

RULE 14
Race does not automatically determine Class.

RULE 15
Race does not automatically determine Star.

RULE 16
Race does not automatically determine combat victory.

RULE 17
Rare Skills can be influenced by Race + Class + Bloodline + Emotion.

RULE 18
Ultimate Skills can be unique to each Hero.

RULE 19
All final racial data is linked to Character_ID.

RULE 20
Race data is stored persistently in the Database System.
```

